---
import works from '../../data/school-image-lab.json';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const classes = [6, 7, 8, 9, 10];
const title = (work: typeof works[number]) => work.title || `${work.team}의 작품`;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="description" content="한영외고 학생들이 학교 안의 문제를 찾아 Teachable Machine으로 만든 School Image Lab 작품 47팀을 만나보세요." />
<title>School Image Lab 학생 작품전 | 한영외국어고등학교</title>
<link rel="canonical" href={`https://jihyuniee.github.io${base}/exhibition/school-image-lab/`} />
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#works">작품으로 바로 가기</a>
<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><span aria-hidden="true" class="mark">HYFL</span>인공지능 원리탐구</a><nav aria-label="전시관 메뉴"><span aria-current="page">학생 작품</span><a href={`${base}/`}>교과서 보기 ↗</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">한영외국어고등학교 · 2026 · 첫 번째 프로젝트</p><h1>School Image Lab</h1><p class="subtitle">학생 작품전</p></div><p class="intro-copy">학교 안에서 발견한 문제를<br />직접 모은 데이터와 AI로 풀어 보았습니다.<br /><span>6·7·8·9·10반, {works.length}팀의 결과물을 만나 보세요.</span></p></section>
<section id="works" aria-label="학생 작품 둘러보기">
<div class="browse-bar"><nav class="class-tabs" aria-label="반별 작품"><button class="class-tab" data-class="all" aria-pressed="true">전체 <span>{works.length}</span></button>{classes.map((classroom) => <button class="class-tab" data-class={classroom} aria-pressed="false">{classroom}반 <span>{works.filter(w => w.classroom === classroom).length}</span></button>)}</nav><a class="lesson-link" href={`${base}/project1/`}>이 프로젝트의 수업 보기 ↗</a></div>
<div class="tools"><p id="result-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">전체 {works.length}작품</p><label class="search"><span class="sr-only">작품·팀·이름 검색</span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5.5" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="m12 12 5 5" stroke="currentColor"/></svg><input type="search" id="work-search" placeholder="작품·팀·이름 검색" /></label></div>
<div class="gallery">
{works.map((work, index) => <article class="work" id={work.id} data-classroom={work.classroom} data-search={`${work.title} ${work.team} ${work.description} ${work.members.join(' ')}`.toLocaleLowerCase('ko')}>
<div class="work-surface"><div class="surface-top"><span>2학년 {work.classroom}반</span><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><h2><a href={work.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{title(work)}</a></h2><p class="surface-team">{work.team}</p>{work.httpStatus !== 200 && <span class="link-note">주소 확인 필요</span>}</div>
<div class="work-info"><p class="description">{work.description || (work.httpStatus === 404 ? '제출된 주소가 현재 열리지 않아 작품 소개를 확인하지 못했습니다.' : '작품 소개를 준비하고 있습니다. 웹앱에서 직접 살펴보세요.')}</p><p class="members">{work.members.join(' · ')}</p><div class="work-actions"><a class="visit" href={work.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">웹앱 열기 ↗</a><button class="detail-button" data-open={work.id} aria-haspopup="dialog">작품 정보</button></div></div>
<template id={`detail-${work.id}`}><p class="modal-meta">2학년 {work.classroom}반 · {work.team}</p><h2 class="modal-title">{title(work)}</h2><p class="modal-members">{work.members.join(' · ')}</p>{work.description && <p class="modal-description">{work.description}</p>}<dl class="status-list"><dt>제출 당시 기록</dt><dd>{work.submittedStatus === 'reported-working' ? '정상 작동으로 제출됨 (9월 제출 기록)' : '작동 여부 별도 기재 없음'}</dd><dt>페이지 접속 확인</dt><dd>{work.httpStatus === 200 ? '2026.11.03 · 페이지 응답 확인 (HTTP 200)' : work.httpStatus === 404 ? '2026.11.03 · 페이지를 찾을 수 없음 (HTTP 404)' : '2026.11.03 · 접속 확인 필요'}</dd></dl><p class="status-note">페이지 접속 확인은 AI 모델·카메라·분류 결과의 정상 작동을 확인했다는 뜻은 아닙니다. 카메라·마이크 권한은 웹앱에서 필요한 경우 직접 선택해 주세요.</p><a class="modal-visit" href={work.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">웹앱 직접 사용하기 ↗</a><section class="project-story"><h3>이 작품의 제작 이야기</h3><p>학생의 설명을 더해 갈 공간입니다. 확인되지 않은 내용은 채우지 않았습니다.</p><ol><li><strong>누구의 어떤 문제를 해결하려 했나요?</strong>{work.question || '학생 설명 준비 중'}</li><li><strong>어떤 데이터에서 무엇을 발견하고, 기능으로 연결했나요?</strong>{work.dataFinding || '학습 데이터·분류 기준·시험에서 발견한 점 준비 중'}</li><li><strong>실제로 입력하면 어떤 결과가 나오나요?</strong>{work.demonstration || (work.httpStatus === 200 ? '위 웹앱에서 직접 체험할 수 있습니다. 시연 기록은 준비 중입니다.' : '현재 실행 주소를 확인하고 있습니다. 시연 기록은 준비 중입니다.')}</li><li><strong>누구에게 도움이 되며, 무엇으로 확인했나요?</strong>{work.verification || '검증 결과·남은 한계·개선점 준비 중'}</li></ol></section></template>
</article>)}
</div><p class="no-results" id="no-results" hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다. 다른 반이나 검색어로 찾아보세요.</p>
<noscript><p class="exhibition-note">모든 작품과 실행 링크는 위 목록에서 볼 수 있습니다. 반별 검색과 작품 정보 펼치기는 JavaScript를 켜면 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></noscript>
</section>
<section class="about"><div><h2>이미지에서 시작한 학교 이야기</h2><p>학교 안의 문제를 찾고, 데이터를 모아 모델을 학습하고, 새로운 입력으로 시험한 결과물입니다. 사진뿐 아니라 소리 등 다양한 입력을 활용한 작품도 함께 전시합니다.</p></div><div><h2>작품을 직접 사용해 보세요</h2><p>무엇을 구분하도록 가르쳤는지, 다른 조건에서도 같은 결과가 나오는지 살펴보세요. 학생이 만든 웹앱은 새 창으로 열립니다.</p><a href={`${base}/project1/`}>School Image Lab 수업 보기 →</a></div></section>
<p class="exhibition-note">팀명·팀원·실행 주소는 제출 자료를 기준으로 정리했습니다. 작품명과 짧은 소개는 원본 웹앱에서 확인한 내용을 사용했으며, 페이지 접속 상태와 제작 이야기는 구분해 표시합니다.</p>
</main>
<footer><p>한영외국어고등학교 · 인공지능 원리탐구</p><p>School Image Lab · 2026 학생 작품 기록</p></footer>
<dialog id="work-dialog" aria-labelledby="work-dialog-title"><div class="dialog-top"><span>School Image Lab</span><button id="close-dialog" aria-label="작품 정보 닫기">×</button></div><div id="dialog-content"></div></dialog>
<script>
const works = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.work')];
const buttons = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.class-tab')];
const search = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#work-search')!;
let classroom = 'all';
const filter = () => {
 const query = search.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('ko'); let count = 0;
 for (const work of works) { const visible = (classroom === 'all' || work.dataset.classroom === classroom) && (!query || work.dataset.search?.includes(query)); work.hidden = !visible; if (visible) count++; }
 document.querySelector('#result-count')!.textContent = `${classroom === 'all' ? '전체' : classroom + '반'} ${count}작품`;
 (document.querySelector('#no-results') as HTMLElement).hidden = count > 0;
};
buttons.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => { classroom = button.dataset.class!; buttons.forEach(b => b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b === button))); filter(); }));
search.addEventListener('input', filter);
const dialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('#work-dialog')!;
let trigger: HTMLElement | null = null;
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-open]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
 const template = document.getElementById(`detail-${button.dataset.open}`) as HTMLTemplateElement;
 const content = document.querySelector('#dialog-content')!;
 content.replaceChildren(template.content.cloneNode(true)); content.querySelector('h2')!.id = 'work-dialog-title'; trigger = button; dialog.showModal();
}));
document.querySelector('#close-dialog')!.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
dialog.addEventListener('close', () => trigger?.focus());
dialog.addEventListener('click', event => { if (event.target === dialog) { const r = dialog.getBoundingClientRect(); if (event.clientX < r.left || event.clientX > r.right || event.clientY < r.top || event.clientY > r.bottom) dialog.close(); } });
</script>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#242824;background:#fff;color-scheme:light}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #315c4f;outline-offset:4px}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}header,main,footer{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 80px));margin:auto}.skip{position:absolute;top:-100px;background:#fff;padding:12px}.skip:focus{top:0}.site-header{height:86px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #dedfda}.brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.035em}.mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:29px;height:29px;border:1px solid #343a34;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:-.035em}.site-header nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:12px}.site-header nav a{color:#686e66;text-decoration:none}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:end;padding:57px 0 43px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;color:#6c736c}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(30px,3.3vw,43px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin-top:15px}.subtitle{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-top:7px;color:#737a70}.intro-copy{justify-self:end;color:#555e52;font-size:14px;line-height:1.95}.intro-copy span{font-size:12px;color:#737b70}.browse-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #dedfda}.class-tabs{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.class-tab{background:none;color:#747b70;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding:15px 0;font-size:13px}.class-tab span{font-size:10px;vertical-align:super;padding-left:4px}.class-tab[aria-pressed=true]{border-bottom-color:#292e27;color:#292e27;font-weight:700}.lesson-link{font-size:12px;color:#6c7468;text-decoration:none}.tools{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin:22px 0 27px}.tools>p{font-size:12px;color:#747c6e}.search{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #b6beb0;color:#838a7d}.search input{border:0;background:transparent;width:180px;font-size:12px;padding:8px 0;color:#30392b}.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:38px 27px}.work{min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:20px}.work-surface{min-height:205px;padding:19px 22px;background:#f3f4ef;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid #d8ddcf;position:relative}.work:nth-child(3n+2) .work-surface{background:#f3f1ec;border-top-color:#dfd9cc}.work:nth-child(3n) .work-surface{background:#f0f2f3;border-top-color:#d5dadd}.surface-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#858b7e;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.03em}.work-surface h2{font-size:23px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:auto 0;padding:17px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.work-surface h2 a{text-decoration:none}.work-surface h2 a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.surface-team{color:#7b8371;font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.link-note{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;color:#965a33;margin-top:9px}.work-info{padding:16px 1px 0}.description{color:#666f5d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;min-height:45px;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.members{margin-top:12px;color:#808775;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8}.work-actions{border-top:1px solid #e2e5db;margin-top:13px;padding-top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;font-size:12px}.visit{text-decoration:none}.detail-button{background:none;border:0;color:#787f6e;padding:3px 0;font-size:11px}.visit:hover,.detail-button:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px;border-top:1px solid #dedfda;border-bottom:1px solid #dedfda;margin:65px 0 22px;padding:30px 0}.about h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:12px}.about p{font-size:13px;color:#747d6b;line-height:1.9;max-width:450px}.about>div+div{border-left:1px solid #dedfda;padding-left:35px}.about a{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #71796b;margin-top:16px;padding-bottom:3px}.exhibition-note{font-size:11px;color:#878e7e;line-height:1.9;max-width:860px}.no-results{padding:70px 0;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#747d6b}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:40px;padding-bottom:32px;font-size:11px;color:#8b9283;line-height:1.8}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap}[hidden]{display:none!important}dialog{width:min(720px,calc(100% - 28px));max-height:calc(100dvh - 40px);padding:0;border:1px solid #dedfda;background:white;color:#242824;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#18201865}.dialog-top{position:sticky;top:0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:white;padding:17px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid #dedfda;font-size:11px;color:#7e8676;z-index:1}.dialog-top button{border:0;background:none;font-size:25px;line-height:1;padding:0 3px;color:#525c48}#dialog-content{padding:27px}.modal-meta{font-size:12px;color:#747d6b}.modal-title{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:12px 0 10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.modal-members{font-size:12px;color:#747d6b}.modal-description{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;margin-top:25px}.status-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;margin:25px 0 12px}.status-list dt{color:#747d6b}.status-list dd{margin:0}.status-note{font-size:11px;color:#858e7b;line-height:1.9}.modal-visit{display:inline-block;background:#2e3d30;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;padding:12px 18px;margin-top:23px}.project-story{border-top:1px solid #dedfda;margin-top:28px;padding-top:23px}.project-story h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.project-story p{font-size:12px;color:#747d6b;line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0 19px}.project-story ol{padding-left:20px;margin-bottom:0}.project-story li{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#92998a;margin-bottom:18px}.project-story strong{display:block;font-weight:500;color:#59644f;margin-bottom:4px}@media(max-width:900px){header,main,footer{width:calc(100% - 48px)}.gallery{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.lesson-link{display:none}.intro-copy{font-size:13px}.class-tabs{gap:24px}}@media(max-width:600px){header,main,footer{width:calc(100% - 36px)}.site-header{height:70px}.brand{font-size:12px;gap:8px}.site-header nav{gap:12px;font-size:11px}.site-header nav>span{display:none}.intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:33px 0 28px;gap:22px}.intro h1{font-size:32px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px}.intro-copy{justify-self:start;font-size:13px}.intro-copy br:first-of-type{display:none}.class-tabs{gap:18px;flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%}.class-tab{white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px}.class-tab span{font-size:9px;padding-left:2px}.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:29px}.work-surface{min-height:180px}.description{min-height:0}.search input{width:155px}.about{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;margin-top:42px}.about>div+div{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #dedfda;padding:24px 0 0}.status-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px}.status-list dd{margin-bottom:10px}footer{display:block}footer p+p{margin-top:5px}.modal-title{font-size:23px}}
</style>
</body>
</html>
